<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>for my babyy ♡</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600&family=DM+Mono:wght@400&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background: #0d0b0b;
      color: #eee7dc;
      font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* subtle film grain */

    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0.055;
      z-index: 100;
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 180 180' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='.8'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    }

    section {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 25px;
    }

    .tiny {
      font-family: "DM Mono", monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #9e8980;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
      font-size: clamp(65px, 18vw, 150px);
      line-height: 0.8;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -5px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
      font-size: 25px;
      font-style: italic;
      color: #bca79d;
      margin-top: 35px;
    }

    .scroll {
      margin-top: 80px;
      font-family: "DM Mono", monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #806e67;
    }

    .scroll span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    /* letter */

    .letter {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 120px 28px;
    }

    .date {
      font-family: "DM Mono", monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: #806e67;
      margin-bottom: 45px;
    }

    .letter h2 {
      font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
      font-size: 43px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 38px;
    }

    .letter-text {
      font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
      font-size: 23px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #e4dbd1;
    }

    .letter-text p {
      margin-bottom: 27px;
    }

    .heart {
      color: #8e4d4b;
    }

    /* photos */

    .photo-section {
      padding: 70px 18px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .photo-wrap {
      width: min(90vw, 650px);
    }

    .photo-wrap img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: saturate(0.82) contrast(0.95);
    }

    .caption {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-top: 13px;
      padding: 0 4px;
      font-family: "DM Mono", monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      color: #74635e;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .tilt-left {
      transform: rotate(-1.2deg);
    }

    .tilt-right {
      transform: rotate(1deg);
    }

    .tilt-small {
      transform: rotate(-0.5deg);
    }

    /* little divider */

    .divider {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 70px 0;
      color: #594a46;
      font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
      font-size: 25px;
    }

    /* gallery */

    .gallery {
      padding: 90px 18px;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .gallery-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .gallery-title span {
      font-family: "DM Mono", monospace;
      color: #806e67;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .gallery-title h2 {
      font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
      font-size: 48px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .gallery-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .gallery-grid img {
      width: 100%;
      display: block;
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: saturate(0.8);
    }

    .gallery-grid img:nth-child(2) {
      margin-top: 35px;
    }

    .gallery-grid img:nth-child(3) {
      margin-top: -20px;
    }

    .gallery-grid img:nth-child(4) {
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    /* music */

    .music {
      padding: 120px 22px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .music-small {
      font-family: "DM Mono", monospace;
      color: #806e67;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .music h2 {
      font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
      font-size: 50px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin: 12px 0 35px;
    }

    .music p {
      font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-style: italic;
      color: #aa9790;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .spotify {
      width: min(100%, 500px);
      margin: auto;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .spotify iframe {
      width: 100%;
      height: 152px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    /* final */

    .final {
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 80px 18px 50px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .final img {
      width: min(92vw, 700px);
      max-height: 75vh;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      filter: saturate(0.8) contrast(0.95);
      margin-bottom: 55px;
    }

    .final h2 {
      font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
      font-size: clamp(40px, 10vw, 75px);
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 0.95;
    }

    .final p {
      margin-top: 25px;
      font-family: "DM Mono", monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: #806e67;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 50px 20px 70px;
      font-family: "DM Mono", monospace;
      font-size: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: #544844;
    }

    /* animations */

    .fade {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(25px);
      animation: fadeUp 1.2s ease forwards;
    }

    @keyframes fadeUp {
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {

      .letter {
        padding: 90px 25px;
      }

      .letter h2 {
        font-size: 38px;
      }

      .letter-text {
        font-size: 21px;
      }

      .gallery-grid {
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .gallery-title h2 {
        font-size: 42px;
      }

    }

  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- HERO -->

  <section class="hero fade">

    <div class="tiny">
      boyfriend's day · 2026
    </div>

    <h1>for you.</h1>

    <p>a little something from your shreeya</p>

    <div class="scroll">
      scroll slowly
      <span>↓</span>
    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- LETTER -->

  <section class="letter fade">

    <div class="date">
      03 · 10 · 2026
    </div>

    <h2>hieee babyyyu</h2>

    <div class="letter-text">

      <p>
        happy boyfriend’s dayyy my lovee
        <span class="heart">❤️❤️❤️</span>
      </p>

      <p>
        idk what to even write because i feel like no matter how much i say,
        it’ll never actually be enough to explain how much you mean to me.
        but i still wanted to make something for you because you deserve to know how loved you are.
      </p>

      <p>
        you’ve become such a big part of my life and i genuinely don’t know
        what i’d do without you now. you’re literally the person i wanna tell
        everything to, annoy all the time, laugh with over the dumbest things
        and just be with even when we’re doing absolutely nothing.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- PHOTO 1 -->

  <section class="photo-section fade">

    <div class="photo-wrap tilt-left">

      <img
        src="4834A51A-CC73-437B-A62B-AD92DA5AFBDA.jpeg"
        alt="us"
      >

      <div class="caption">
        <span>you + me</span>
        <span>01</span>
      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <div class="divider">♡</div>


  <!-- LETTER CONTINUED -->

  <section class="letter fade">

    <div class="letter-text">

      <p>
        i love so many little things about you that i don’t think you even realise.
        your voice, your laugh, your stupid jokes, the way you talk, the way you are
        with me literally just you. and sometimes i’ll randomly look at you or think
        about you and be like “waittt that’s actually my boyfriend” 😭 and it makes me so happy.
      </p>

      <p>
        we obviously have our stupid moments and we annoy each other and everything
        isn’t always perfect, but i wouldn’t trade what we have for anything.
        because at the end of the day, it’s still you. always you.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- PHOTO 2 -->

  <section class="photo-section fade">

    <div class="photo-wrap tilt-right">

      <img
        src="4BD3B496-FA2D-4040-826F-2D61F5CF73B9.jpeg"
        alt="us"
      >

      <div class="caption">
        <span>my favourite idiot</span>
        <span>02</span>
      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- PHOTO 3 -->

  <section class="photo-section fade">

    <div class="photo-wrap tilt-small">

      <img
        src="6FBC3DB7-D852-45F5-9175-8C4A4E15F2F4.jpeg"
        alt="us"
      >

      <div class="caption">
        <span>just us</span>
        <span>03</span>
      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <div class="divider">♡</div>


  <!-- LETTER CONTINUED -->

  <section class="letter fade">

    <div class="letter-text">

      <p>
        thank you for being my person and for giving me so many memories that
        i’ll always keep close to my heart. i hope we make sooo many more.
      </p>

      <p>
        happy boyfriend’s day baby
        <span class="heart">❤️❤️❤️❤️</span>
      </p>

      <p>
        i love you so so so much. more than i can properly put into words.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- PHOTO 4 -->

  <section class="photo-section fade">

    <div class="photo-wrap tilt-left">

      <img
        src="7271E472-5373-4492-90E1-1E86B0A67611.jpeg"
        alt="us"
      >

      <div class="caption">
        <span>another memory</span>
        <span>04</span>
      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- GALLERY -->

  <section class="gallery fade">

    <div class="gallery-title">

      <span>little archive</span>

      <h2>us, lately.</h2>

    </div>

    <div class="gallery-grid">

      <img
        src="8F9F67F1-EB06-4280-97B9-917C032923C6.jpeg"
        alt="us"
      >

      <img
        src="7A9EAE69-17CC-4DB6-B554-62AFA2851B8D.jpeg"
        alt="us"
      >

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- MUSIC -->

  <section class="music fade">

    <div class="music-small">
      this one feels like us
    </div>

    <h2>our song.</h2>

    <p>Lady Of Namek — Tory Lanez</p>

    <div class="spotify">

      <iframe
        src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/44KsnNC0GBekRDDq1nPrXg"
        title="Lady Of Namek by Tory Lanez"
        allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
        loading="lazy">
      </iframe>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- FINAL -->

  <section class="final fade">

    <img
      src="7A9EAE69-17CC-4DB6-B554-62AFA2851B8D.jpeg"
      alt="us"
    >

    <h2>it’s always<br>going to be you.</h2>

    <p>now come here i need my hug 🫵🏻😳</p>

  </section>


  <footer>
    made with way too much love ♡
  </footer>


</body>
</html>
